{"root":"jengkel","ipa":"/dʒɛŋkəl/","core":"形容词，表示因受到冒犯、失望或厌烦而产生的恼火、愤恨或不悦的情绪。","pos":["形容词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/dʒɛŋkəl/","zh":"恼火的，愤恨的，厌烦的","phrases":[{"t":"merasa jengkel","zh":"感到恼火"},{"t":"sangat jengkel","zh":"非常愤恨"},{"t":"perasaan jengkel","zh":"恼怒的情绪"}],"examples":[{"t":"Saya merasa jengkel karena dia selalu datang terlambat.","zh":"我感到很恼火，因为他总是迟到。"},{"t":"Jangan membuat dia jengkel dengan pertanyaan itu.","zh":"别用那个问题让他感到厌烦。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"jengkel","ipa":"/dʒɛŋkəl/","zh":"恼火的","phrase":{"t":"jengkel sekali","zh":"极其恼火"},"example":{"t":"Dia jengkel melihat kelakuan anak itu.","zh":"看到那个孩子的行为，他感到很恼火。"}},{"w":"kejengkelan","ipa":"/kədʒɛŋkəlan/","zh":"恼怒，愤恨（名词）","phrase":{"t":"menahan kejengkelan","zh":"压抑怒火"},"example":{"t":"Dia tidak bisa menyembunyikan kejengkelannya.","zh":"他无法掩饰自己的恼怒。"}},{"w":"menjengkelkan","ipa":"/məndʒɛŋkəlkan/","zh":"令人恼火的，惹人厌的","phrase":{"t":"hal yang menjengkelkan","zh":"令人恼火的事情"},"example":{"t":"Sikapnya sangat menjengkelkan semua orang.","zh":"他的态度让所有人都感到很厌烦。"}}],"derSlugs":["jengkel","kejengkelan","menjengkelkan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-28T02:38:10.669Z","src":"base"}